      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ops: Eval Runner (manual)\nEdit the **Settings** node, then Execute. Replays the automation's eval_cases through the AI Gateway with the chosen prompt version and saves an eval_runs row. scripts/activate-prompt.sh only activates a version that passed in the last 24h.\nredactMode: empty, contact or full. redactField: the input field to redact (e.g. cv_text).",
